# ========== Sensitive Data ==========
# Source data files (company proprietary)
data/input/*
data/output/*
data/cache/*
!data/input/.gitkeep
!data/output/.gitkeep

# ── Sample dummy data (fiktif, untuk showcase) — di-track ──────────────
